# Terraform Provider — Kilhog

This repository is a **Terraform Plugin Framework** provider for Kilhog.

## Stack

- Go 1.25+ with **Terraform Plugin Framework** (not SDK v2)
- `terraform-plugin-testing` for acceptance and unit tests
- `terraform-plugin-docs` (`tfplugindocs`) for registry documentation
- GNU Make, golangci-lint, GoReleaser

## Layout

- `main.go` — provider entry point (`providerserver.Serve`)
- `internal/provider/` — provider implementation using `github.com/kilhog-io/kilhog/pkg/kilhog`
- `examples/` — Terraform configs consumed by doc generation
- `docs/` — auto-generated; never edit by hand
- `tools/` — separate Go module for `go generate`

## Commands

```bash
make build      # compile
make test       # unit tests
make testacc    # acceptance tests (TF_ACC=1, needs Terraform)
make lint       # golangci-lint
make generate   # headers, fmt examples, regenerate docs
make fmt        # gofmt
```

## CI expectations

- `make generate` must produce no diff (docs drift fails CI)
- Acceptance tests run against Terraform 1.13.* and 1.14.*
- Do not import `terraform-plugin-sdk/v2` (blocked by depguard)

## Scope discipline

- Match existing patterns in `internal/provider/kilhog_*.go` when adding new resources.
- Register new resources/data sources in `provider.go`
- Depend on the published `github.com/kilhog-io/kilhog` module; local SDK work may use a temporary `replace` or `go.work` (do not commit machine-local paths)
